    "description": "Lets a kitchen manager see inventory health at a glance, with anything that needs reordering elevated to the top and out-of-stock items called out. One-click adjust flow updates a count without leaving the page. \u2014 Triage + List Manager: ProgressBar hero, urgency Tile grid, and DataTable with filters + adjust Modal.",
